@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Reserva de turnos
actor "Paciente habilitado" as Paciente
actor "Representante verificado" as Representante
actor "Profesional autorizado" as Profesional
actor "Secretaría delegada" as Secretaria
rectangle "Sistema de Gestión Administrativa de Salud" {
 usecase "CU-14\nReservar Consulta por portal" as C14
 usecase "CU-15\nRegistrar turno desde personal" as C15
 usecase "CU-36\nAdquirir pre-reserva" as C36
 usecase "CU-37\nCompletar registro de turno" as C37
}
Paciente -- C14
Representante -- C14
Profesional -- C15
Secretaria -- C15
C14 ..> C36 : <<include>>
C14 ..> C37 : <<include>>
C15 ..> C36 : <<include>>
C15 ..> C37 : <<include>>
note as Restricciones
Solo Consulta base habilitada permite selección por paciente.
Autorización y auditoría son restricciones transversales.
end note
@enduml
